      "options": {
        "content": "**Windows / WSL note**\n\nNode Exporter is running inside the Docker Desktop Linux VM. Host CPU, memory, load, and network panels describe that VM, not native Windows. Filesystem panels can include mounted Windows drive capacity such as `/mnt/host/c` and `/mnt/host/e`, plus the Docker Desktop VM disk at `/mnt/docker-desktop-disk`.\n\nFor native Windows host metrics, deploy Windows Exporter on the Windows host and add it as a separate Prometheus target.",
